Dil Chori guitar chords with strumming pattern from movie Sonu Ke Tittu Ki Sweety sung by Yo Yo Honey Singh, Simar Kaur and Ishers.

Welcome back Yo Yo Honey Singh. After struglling with bipolar disorder for a long time he is now back in the business to entertain us.

Check out the Basic Strumming Patterns

